'''Chroma Darkbringer''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Unlike most guns, the Chroma Darkbringer is not a revolver, although it looks and sounds like one. The whole gun is a pathbringer, but black in color. The handle is a colored grip. The barrel also has colored stripes. There is a wing-like shape in the center of the gun that is also colored. The trigger is also colored, but the cover of the trigger is black. It alternates in color on its grip, barrel, wing, and trigger.

== Trivia ==
* The chroma counterpart of the godly gun under the name [[Darkbringer]], which can be found in the same box.  
* It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].  
* It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.  
* Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it was a victim of [[The Duping Glitch (2021)]].  
* It is part of a set with the chroma gun [[Chroma Lightbringer]] making the Chroma Bringer Set.  
* Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the [[crafting]] station.

